 n\, inspire\, and delight audiences of all ages. A celebration of imaginat
 ion\, drama\, and musical storytelling - this is an evening not to be miss
 ed! The café and bar will be trading\, so enjoy the concert with a meal a
 nd a glass of wine. Please note that there are no BYO food or drinks\, jus
 t bring your own picnic blankets and enjoy music under the stars.
